<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 651 0 R
/E (Customer churn is a major concern in the competitive telecommunications industry, as it directly affects revenue and long-term profitability. This project analyzes real-world data from a telecom provider to understand the key factors driving customer attrition. Using exploratory data analysis \(EDA\), feature engineering, and machine learning, the goal is to identify customers at risk of churning and offer actionable strategies to improve customer retention and satisfaction.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
>>
