/S /H1
/T (Random Search Code     We implemented a random search strategy to explore a wide hyperparameter space with less computational cost compared to full grid search.  Why Random Search? Faster than grid search when the parameter space is large. Often finds near-optimal solutions with fewer trials. Adds randomness that can lead to discovering unexpected good combinations.  How it works: Randomly selects values for hidden1, hidden2, and lr for a fixed number of iterations \(n_iter=10\). Trains the model on each combination and tracks performance.)
/E (Random Search Code     We implemented a random search strategy to explore a wide hyperparameter space with less computational cost compared to full grid search.  Why Random Search? Faster than grid search when the parameter space is large. Often finds near-optimal solutions with fewer trials. Adds randomness that can lead to discovering unexpected good combinations.  How it works: Randomly selects values for hidden1, hidden2, and lr for a fixed number of iterations \(n_iter=10\). Trains the model on each combination and tracks performance.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1]
>>
